# A computer is a system

Input → processing → output, with storage

---

## Keep these distinct

RAM: active work

Storage: persistent files

CPU: executes instructions

---

## OS responsibilities

Scheduling • memory • files • devices • permissions

---

## Higher Level: instruction cycle

Fetch → decode → execute

PC, control unit, ALU and registers

---

## Trace together

LOAD 9 → ADD 3 → STORE count

When does count change?

---

## Translation is not proof

Syntax, runtime and logic errors differ.

